  "root_problem": "Billing dispute ticket volume doubled from ~600/month (Jun–Jul 2026) to ~1220/month (Aug–Sep 2026) (E-02), not because response handling is slow (E-01 shows median/p90 times within the 3.0-day SLA), but at least partly because field manual-read route completion fell to 0.88 against a 0.95 target across 9200 accounts in Aug–Sep (E-03), forcing estimate substitution that accounts for the 1240 ESTIMATED-read-type disputed bills (E-04). This mechanism does not explain the majority of disputes, which involve ACTUAL-read-type bills (1785/3025, E-04) whose cause is not yet established (tariff change ruled out, E-06)."
